    "detailed_description": "<h1>Update Notes</h1><p>- Blopper UI image fixed - No longer visible in the settings menu or the bugs screen.<br>- Play button fixed - The whole button is now clickable, this was due to the blopper text's raycast padding over lapping the button.<br>- Fixed level 25 spawn - Player spawned at the bottom of the level, no spawns at the top.<br>- Fixed player rotation - If pressing &quot;UpArrow&quot; key the player would rotate and cause the player to start floating when jumping and making the player unmovable.</p><br><h1>Update Notes</h1><p>Update 2: <br> - Shop no longer in the game - Due to it not fully finished and wasn't meant to be in the demo. <br>- Fixed level 51 collider not appearing<br>- Fixed level 51 and 52 level labels being wrong.<br>- Fixed text overlapping in the upgrade shop.<br>- Fixed dialogue from repeating on levels 21 to 54</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Embark on a gravity-defying adventure in &quot;Blopper&quot; a vibrant and bouncy dropper game that challenges your reflexes and strategic skills! Take control of the hero, a lively green slime with a penchant for bouncing, as it navigates through a mesmerizing realm where gravity is but a whimsical plaything.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >key Features</h2><br>\ud83c\udf08 <strong>Bounce Through Whimsical Realms -</strong> Dive into a world of floating platforms, swirling vortexes, and neon-lit droppers. Each level presents a visually stunning and dynamically shifting landscape that will keep you on the edge of your seat.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/11b27c886c32d0ee3ba13bbf8187126d.poster.avif?t=1718746084\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/11b27c886c32d0ee3ba13bbf8187126d.webm?t=1718746084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/11b27c886c32d0ee3ba13bbf8187126d.mp4?t=1718746084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Unlock Unique Abilities -</strong> As you conquer each level, unlock new abilities in the shop that add an extra layer of strategy to your descent. Fall in slow motion, gain temporary invincibility and an extra jump to overcome challenges.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/83d60554080275ca0815b649a88b4468.poster.avif?t=1718746084\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/83d60554080275ca0815b649a88b4468.webm?t=1718746084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/83d60554080275ca0815b649a88b4468.mp4?t=1718746084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udf0c <strong>Mysterious Guide -</strong> Meet a mysterious cat with spectral eyes, who acts as your guide through the gravity-defying journey. Unravel the secrets of Blopper as the cat provides cryptic advice and hints about the ancient magic that binds the realm together.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/de4a147047a3261dddf83233ccf98ec6.poster.avif?t=1718746084\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/de4a147047a3261dddf83233ccf98ec6.webm?t=1718746084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/de4a147047a3261dddf83233ccf98ec6.mp4?t=1718746084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Explore Diverse Environments -</strong> Dive through the Dark Gloomy Caves, In outer space, Slime Glades, soar over Enchanted Ethereal Forests, and discover the Crystal Nexus at the heart of Blopper. Each new setting introduces unique challenges, puzzles, and breath-taking landscapes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/83cdac77910b0c0862c942dd9cfbdf29.poster.avif?t=1718746084\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/83cdac77910b0c0862c942dd9cfbdf29.webm?t=1718746084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/83cdac77910b0c0862c942dd9cfbdf29.mp4?t=1718746084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Master the Dropper Challenges -</strong> Navigate through intricate structures, avoid obstacles, and collect magical coins to unlock new abilities, and find portals leading to the next set of levels. Test your reflexes, timing, and problem-solving skills in a series of increasingly complex dropper challenges.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/ead8f24c7f31cd57144f6da4414bc295.poster.avif?t=1718746084\" width=600 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/ead8f24c7f31cd57144f6da4414bc295.webm?t=1718746084\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795730/extras/ead8f24c7f31cd57144f6da4414bc295.mp4?t=1718746084\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Save The World of Blopper -</strong> Uncover the true purpose of Blopper and face the ultimate challenge to preserve the delicate balance between realms. Will You and the cat succeed in saving the realm, or will Blopper succumb to the impending darkness?<br><br>&quot;Blopper&quot; is not just a game; it's an enchanting journey where a lively slime and a mysterious cat unravel the secrets of a gravity-defying world. Are you ready to take the plunge?",
